			"widgets_values":[
				"Use the uploaded poster frame (stylized photo of a girl leaning against a two-tone wall—red left, white right—carrying a black tote bag with a yellow smiley, with on-screen text: \"New Semester\" in pink/black, Chinese slogan \"帆布包买就送个性贴纸，书包配件全场 9 折\", and \"LIXIAOXIAO DESIGN\" at bottom) as the exact scene/style/layout reference.​\nOutput: 1080×1920 portrait, 24 fps, 6 s, one continuous take, no audio. Lighting: soft studio key light from camera-left, fill from camera-right to keep wall colors vivid (red saturation preserved, white wall clean). Render style: photorealistic with cinematic color grading.​\nHard Constraints​\nAll on-screen text (content, font, position, color, size) stays exactly as in the reference until specified timing-based changes. No shimmer, no parallax; text remains locked to the wall except for the timed \"New Semester\" repositioning.​\nPG, upbeat campus vibe. No new props.​\nNatural body mechanics & cloth physics: tote bag sways realistically, denim pants have subtle crease movement, striped top stretches naturally.​\nAction Timeline​\n0.0–1.5 s — Lean & Pose: Start on the original composition (girl leaning against the red wall, body angled ~30° to camera, left shoulder against the wall, right hand gripping the tote bag strap). She maintains this relaxed pose, eyes looking toward camera with a soft smile. Camera locked, static framing.​\n1.5–3.0 s — Stand & Text Fade: She smoothly rises from the lean to full standing, turning to face the camera squarely (body now front-facing). As she stands, all on-screen text (including \"New Semester\", the Chinese slogan, and \"LIXIAOXIAO DESIGN\") fades to 0% opacity with a natural ease-out curve over 1.5 s (subtler fade in the final 0.3 s). Cloth physics: striped top hem & denim pant legs sway gently with the standing motion; tote bag swings softly as she straightens, then settles.​\n3.0–4.5 s — Thumb-Up & Heart Pop: Once fully standing, she raises her right hand to chest level, extending the thumb upward in a confident 点赞 gesture (fingers relaxed, palm facing slightly toward camera). At 3.5 s, a small pink heart (matching \"New Semester\" pink tone) appears 2 cm above her thumb, expands 10% over 0.1 s, then instantly vanishes (0.2 s total visibility). Her expression brightens into a warm smile, eyes locked on camera.​\n4.5–6.0 s — Title Center & Disappear: As the thumb-up gesture holds, the text \"New Semester\" fades in with a natural ease-in curve (subtler start) to the center of the frame (matching original font/style/color, repositioned to absolute center). After 0.5 s of full visibility, the girl fades out with an ease-out curve over 1 s while \"New Semester\" remains centered. The clip ends with \"New Semester\" static in the center, wall background clean.​\nRendering Notes​\nExposure/white balance constant (red wall RGB saturation stable, white wall pure #FFFFFF). No flicker.​\nWall text (when visible) stays razor-sharp: consistent kerning, antialiasing, and position (until \"New Semester\" centers at 4.5 s).​\nSubtle contact shadows: When leaning, her shoulder/back cast soft shadows on the red wall; when standing, feet press slightly into the white floor (subtle shadow compression under soles).​\nCloth dynamics: Tote bag fabric wrinkles naturally during standing, striped top stretches gently at the shoulders, denim retains natural knee creases.​\nFade transitions: Text/girl fades use smooth curves (ease-in/ease-out) for organic motion; heart pop uses sharp scaling for playful contrast.​\nHeart detail: Semi-transparent (80% opacity) with slight glow, matching the scene's soft lighting."
